@startuml
title C: Field / Synergy（最終調整）

class UYGSynergySystem <<UWorldSubsystem>>
class FYGSynergyRequest { +Element +Location +Instigator }
class FYGElementBalanceConstants
class AYGElementFieldActor
class UYGFieldContainerComponent
class AYGColumnActor { +bReplicates=true }
class AYGProjectileActor { +bReplicates=true +SetReplicatedMovement(true) <<when needed>> }
class AYGSteamCloudActor { +bReplicates=true <<when needed>> }

AYGElementFieldActor --> UYGFieldContainerComponent
UYGSynergySystem --> FYGSynergyRequest
UYGSynergySystem --> FYGElementBalanceConstants
UYGSynergySystem --> AYGColumnActor : Spawn(Host)
UYGSynergySystem --> AYGProjectileActor : Spawn(Host)
UYGSynergySystem --> AYGSteamCloudActor : Spawn(Host)

note right of UYGSynergySystem
生成座標:
- 既定: Field重心
- 衝突点優先（任意）
所有権:
- Request.Instigator 継承
同期:
- Host Spawn
- 動く生成物は ReplicatedMovement を検討
end note

@enduml
